        251.76
      ],
      "text": "Subject: Filling up the post of Secretary (JS level), Coastal Aquaculture Authority (CAA), Chennai under the Department of Fisheries."
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 12,
      "poly": [
        60.69,
        256.81,
        120.19,
        256.81,
        120.19,
        269.44,
        60.69,
        269.44
      ],
      "text": "Sir/Madam,"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 13,
      "poly": [
        59.5,
        282.07,
        535.5,
        282.07,
        535.5,
        320.8,
        59.5,
        320.8
      ],
      "text": "It is proposed to fill up the post of Secretary (JS level), Coastal Aquaculture Authority (CAA), Chennai under the Department of Fisheries with pay at Level 14 (Rs.1,44,200-2,18,200/-) of the Pay Matrix on deputation basis."
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 14,
      "poly": [
        58.91,
        332.59,
        536.1,
        332.59,
        536.1,
        410.05,
        58.91,
        410.05
      ],
      "text": "2. Names of willing and eligible officers, who have been empanelled to hold Joint Secretary or equivalent posts at the Centre under the Central Staffing Scheme may be recommended to this office along with cadre clearance, vigilance clearance and detailed bio-data (through SUPREMO link: https://supremo.nic.in). In case the officers are currently on deputation outside the cadre, the nomination may be forwarded with the approval of the competent authority/Minister-in-charge concerned."
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 15,
      "poly": [
        58.91,
        421.84,
        536.1,
        421.84,
        536.1,
        513.62,
        58.91,
        513.62
      ],
      "text": "3. The last date for submission of application for the above referred circular is 25.02.2024. Nominations are to be routed through DoPT online interface (DoPT website>>EO Division>>Apply for posts of CSS, CVO and Others >>SUPREMO > [choose Non-CSS category through SUPREMO link: https://supremo.nic.in) for those officers who have not yet applied for any other posts online this year. Nominations as well as all correspondence on the subject may be routed through email id: dirsm@nic.in and useosm1@nic.in only. This office is not accepting any physical communication."
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 16,
